#: ../../../DirectX/DXILResources.md:555
msgid ""
"For Textures, the coordinates are a scalar for 1D textures and a vector of 2 "
"or 3 elements for the higher dimensional and array textures. Like "
"TypedBuffer, a store writes a whole texel, so partial writes have to be "
"expressed as a read-modify-write of the full value."
msgstr ""

